==Trivia==
*Night beasts used to have the highest combat level out of the superior Slayer monsters. They have since been surpassed by [[guardian drake]]s.
*Dark beasts received a 60% Earth elemental weakness in the [[Update:Summer_Sweep_Up:_Combat|25 June 2025 Summer Sweep Up update]], but night beasts lack this elemental weakness.
*Its examine text is a reference to the Dark Beast's examine text.

